### Manual LLM relay (TEMPORARY) — answer the backend's Claude calls by hand.
# Needs the stack started with docker-compose.manual-llm.yml.
# Step-by-step: mocks/anthropic-manual-relay/README.md

@relayUrl = http://localhost:4300

### 1. Next prompt waiting for an answer. 204 = nothing pending.
# Copy the response body into a NEW Claude chat.
# @name pending
GET {{relayUrl}}/pending

### 2. Send Claude's answer. Paste it into manual-llm-reply.txt (next to this file) first.
POST {{relayUrl}}/reply/{{pending.response.headers.X-Request-Id}}
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./manual-llm-reply.txt
